contact with the authority in whose domain the situation lies.  If someone
comes to me with a complaint of sexual harassment from a student user, I'll 
direct them to the person in the Dean of Students' office who handles com-
plaints of sexual harassment.  Once the user knows what steps are necessary
to file/process a complaint, I've done my job.

